Package: sciafpad
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: A minimal GTK4 text editor based on Scintilla
 sciafpad is a simple text editor built on top of the
 bugaevc/scintilla GTK4 port. It aims to be as simple as Leafpad
 but uses Scintilla as the editing engine instead of GtkTextView.
 .
 Features: open / save / save as, undo / redo, cut / copy / paste,
 and an about dialog.
